==Acquisition==
*This mod can be purchased <u>unranked</u> from the Void Trader [[Baro Ki'Teer]] for {{cc|175,000}} and {{dc|350}}. Note however that Baro Ki'Teer's stock changes with each appearance, and may not have this item available at every time.

==Notes==
*While it can be installed on any secondary weapon, Primed Fulmination only has noticeable effects on the following explosive weapons{{Column|2|<b></b>
**{{Weapon|Aegrit}}
**{{Weapon|Akarius}} ({{Weapon|Akarius Prime|Prime}})
**{{Weapon|Angstrum}} ({{Weapon|Prisma Angstrum|Prisma}})
